In that model prayer, Jesus included the request: “Do not bring us into temptation, but deliver us from the wicked one. ”
We may be tempted to ignore Bible principles at work or at school.
We may be asked to do something that violates upright principles.
At such times, we do well to follow Jesus ’ counsel to pray — both in advance and when actually facing a temptation — asking God to help us so that we do not fall.
