God’s Word states: “The living are conscious that they will die; but as for the dead, they are conscious of nothing at all, neither do they anymore have wages. ” Since the dead “are conscious of nothing at all, ” they cannot hear, see, speak, feel, or think.
How could they? They are incapable of any work!
